Conference Call / Webcast Details </B></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Coherent will review the Company&#8217;s financial results for its third quarter of fiscal 2026 and business outlook
on Wednesday, May&nbsp;6, at 4:30 p.m. ET. A live webcast and replay of the conference call will be available on the Investor Relations section of the Company&#8217;s website at <U>coherent.com/company/investor-relations</U>. The Company&#8217;s
financial guidance will be limited to the comments on its public quarterly earnings call and the public business outlook statements contained in this press release. </P>
