<P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><U>About Coherent </U></B></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Coherent is the global photonics
leader. We harness photons to drive innovation. Industry leaders in the datacenter, communications, and industrial markets rely on Coherent&#8217;s world-leading technology to fuel their own innovation and growth. </P>
